      "PHH are primary human cells (BSL-2); confirm institutional approval and supply before starting.",
      "Antipyrine is capacity-limited (low E) — verify the outlet concentration is measured at steady state and that no significant PDMS/tubing binding confounds the readout; run a cell-free control to isolate cell-mediated clearance.",
